# iCloud Mail IMAP configuration for mbsync
# Generated by: agent-mail setup

IMAPAccount icloud
Host imap.mail.me.com
Port 993
User __EMAIL__
PassCmd "cat ~/.icloud-app-password"
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore icloud-remote
Account icloud

MaildirStore icloud-local
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel icloud
Far :icloud-remote:
Near :icloud-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
